    "files": {
      "gap-0001-epub-download-link-after-a-resend.md": "---\nid: gap-0001\nstatus: open\nkind: incomplete\nanswer: deferred\nsrd_ref: srd-wishlist-sharing\ndoc_id: epub-delivery\nheading_path:\n  - EPUB Delivery\n  - Download Link\nsearch_terms:\n  - resend download link\n  - EPUB link expiry\nhits: 1\ncreated: 2026-10-04T09:30:00Z\nfilled_by:\n  - ref: epub-delivery#download-link\n    hash: 9a737dab5e0e43e68f2ebe09201180d98355f062bcae93be2ed5d88aa4fb9727\n---\n# EPUB download link after a resend\n\n## Demand\n\nGifting an EPUB from a shared wishlist resends the download link to the\nrecipient; the SRD must say how long the resent link stays valid.\n\n## Detail\n\nThe Download Link section states a 48-hour lifetime and five downloads for\nthe link sent after payment. It does not say whether a resend starts a new\n48-hour window or reuses the original one. Support knows; not yet asked.\n\n## Target claim\n\nA resent download link is valid for 48 hours from the resend.\n"
    },
